     "replacement_lines": [
      "**Correction from Book Quality Lab (CAPSTONE-02B).** The earlier implementation also tested the channel after accepting a ticket as in-policy. That extra condition was absent from the runbook: it could decline an eligible phone request. The predicate above now approves every eligible ticket and escalates everything else. The original measurements remain in `results/ch01.jsonl`; the correction, boundary checks and source hashes are recorded separately in `results/ch36-capstone02b-policy.jsonl`. The displayed walkthrough still matches the existing case set; it did not contain the counterexample that exposed this implementation error.",
